## 🛠 Shared Ingredient Handling Example

Centralized inventory allows multiple dishes to share the exact same raw material stock:

```
                     ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐
                     │          Central Raw Stock (Ingredients)     │
                     │          Paneer: 10.00 kg                     │
                     └──────────────────────┬───────────────────────┘
                                            │
           ┌────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────┐
           │                                │                                │
           ▼                                ▼                                ▼
┌──────────────────────┐        ┌──────────────────────┐        ┌──────────────────────┐
│ Paneer Butter Masala │        │ Paneer Tikka         │        │ Paneer Paratha       │
│ Recipe: 0.25 kg      │        │ Recipe: 0.20 kg      │        │ Recipe: 0.10 kg      │
└──────────────────────┘        └──────────────────────┘        └──────────────────────┘
```

When **1 Paneer Butter Masala** is ordered and completed, 0.25 kg is automatically deducted from central stock (leaving 9.75 kg Paneer available for all dishes).

