- **[ManageInventory.aspx.vb](file:///d:/Cloud%20Kitchen/CLoud%20Kitchen%20Project/Cloud%20Kitchen/Cloud%20Kitchen/Cloud%20Kitchen/Admin/ManageInventory.aspx.vb)**: Code-behind managing tab switches, low stock badges (`🟢 In Stock`, `🟡 Low Stock`, `🔴 Out of Stock`), ingredient management, and recipe proportion updates.
- **[Admin.Master](file:///d:/Cloud%20Kitchen/CLoud%20Kitchen%20Project/Cloud%20Kitchen/Cloud%20Kitchen/Cloud%20Kitchen/Admin/Admin.Master)**: Added "Manage Inventory" link to the Food Menu sidebar navigation.
- **[AddFoodItems.aspx](file:///d:/Cloud%20Kitchen/CLoud%20Kitchen%20Project/Cloud%20Kitchen/Cloud%20Kitchen/Cloud%20Kitchen/Admin/AddFoodItems.aspx)**: Added a **"🥦 Recipe"** direct action button on every food item card linking to the Recipe Builder for that dish (`ManageInventory.aspx?m_id=X`).
